The '''Chef''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|West Village}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. He hosts the Hot Dog Contest.

== Hot Dog Contest ==
The player can speak to the '''Chef''' to start a minute-long hot dog contest. During it, {{Item|Hot Dog}}s will be launched from a furnace, which the player must collect and bring to {{NPCSprite|Joey McPizza}} by right-clicking the pressure plate in front of him. If 50 {{Item|Hot Dog}}s have been brought, the furnace is briefly replaced with an {{Item|Enigma Soul}}. 

